{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_38941","headline":"辞杨侍郎 · 杜荀鹤","name":"辞杨侍郎","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"春在门阑秋未离，不因人荐只因诗。\n半年宾馆成前事，一日侯门失旧知。\n霜岛树凋猿叫夜，湖田谷熟鴈来时。\n西风万里东归去，更把愁心说向谁。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"杜荀鹤","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_38941.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_38941","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"乐府","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}